  "title": "Check for Binary String - GeeksforGeeks",
  "content": "<div class=\"html-chunk\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given a string </span><b><strong>s</strong></b><span>, the task is to check if it is a </span><b><strong>binary string </strong></b><span>or not. A binary string is a string which only contains the characters</span><b><strong> '0' </strong></b><span>and </span><b><strong>'1'</strong></b><span>.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Examples:</strong></b></p><blockquote><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Input: </strong></b><span>s = \"01010101010\"</span><br><b><strong>Output: </strong></b><span>true</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Input: </strong></b><span>s = \"geeks101\"</span><br><b><strong>Output: </strong></b><span>false </span></p></blockquote></div><a id=\"practiceBanner\" class=\"ArticlePracticeBanner_practiceDivBanner__idAxy ArticlePracticeBanner_desktopOnly__r87aW rc0\" href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/check-for-binary/1\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"ArticlePracticeBanner_recommendedDiv__7Q5go\">Try It Yourself<div class=\"ArticlePracticeBanner_icon__UeNv9\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./images/dsa-1113-img-1.svg\" alt=\"redirect icon\" class=\"ArticlePracticeBanner_redirectIcon__mJJ_m undefined\"></div></div></a><div class=\"html-chunk\"><h3 id=\"approach-traverse-the-string-on-time-and-o1-space\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>[Approach] Traverse the String - O(n) Time and O(1) Space</span></h3><blockquote><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The idea is to iterate over all the characters of the string and if we encounter a character other than</span><b><strong> '0'</strong></b><span> or </span><b><strong>'1'</strong></b><span>, then the input string is not a binary string. Otherwise, if all the characters are either '0' or '1', then the input string is a binary string.</span></p></blockquote><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">C++</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"cpp\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-cpp\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"c1\">// C++ Program to check if a string is</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">// binary string or not</span>\n\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">using</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">std</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">isBinary</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">length</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// Check if the character is neither</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// '0' nor '1'</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">!=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'0'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">!=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'1'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">false</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">true</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"01010101010\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">isBinary</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"true\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"false\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}